OL,3,GNEWSAFirm fined #322,500 after worker
OL,4,Akilled by falling steel tube
OL,5,
OL,6,FA firm has been fined #322,500 after a
OL,7,Fworker was killed when heavy steel
OL,8,Ftubes fell during an unloading
OL,9,Foperation in Aberdeen.
OL,11,FMarried father-of-two Albert Ross, 67,
OL,12,Fdied after being struck by one of the
OL,13,Ftubes on the Iberian Bulker vessel at
OL,14,FDunnottar Quay in July 2023.
OL,16,FSea-Cargo Aberdeen Ltd admitted failing
OL,17,Fto have a safe system in work in place,
OL,18,Fwhen the fatal accident happened.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
