OL,4,Akilled by falling steel tube
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Aberdeen Sheriff Court, it was fined
OL,7,F#300,000 along with a #22,500 victim
OL,8,Fsurcharge, a penalty which goes into a
OL,9,Fcentral fund.
